**Summary of the security lens (chunk-d):**

Verified sound (no findings):
- **No new backend surface** — router.gleam untouched; `/demo` is a client-side SPA route (shared/routes gained one `Demo` constructor, additive); the 8 PDFs are served by the pre-existing `["static", ..rest]` handler; `pdf_prebake.gleam` is an inert build-time `main()` with no route wiring.
